<title>USA: NEWARK USD, CALIF., WON BY BANCAMERICA.</title>
<headline>NEWARK USD, CALIF., WON BY BANCAMERICA.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>BancAmerica said it won $7.500 million of Newark USD, Calif., general obligation capital appreciation bond, Election of 1997, Series A, with a net interest cost of 5.63 percent.</p>
</text>
